resolved via typed edges to source records, an immutable ordered collection of gifts
bounded by max items and overflow semantics, and an 'Available in documents' switch
that narrows which fields templates may touch. A walker assembles the Facts Package
the template engine will admit, respecting explicit cycle policy and dead-end handling.
