"""Label-aware augmentation pipeline: model the lineage from source dataset
through an explicit, versioned augmentation policy (with stable per-sample
seed derivation) to a transformed dataset, then traverse it with a walker
that audits reproducibility of every sample.

The core entities are:
- SourceDataset : the raw exported YOLO dataset.
- AugPolicy    : the A.Compose pipeline serialized as a dict artifact.
- SeedSchedule : the rule that combines pipeline seed + sample id into a
                 deterministic per-sample seed (so order of execution does
                 not perturb the result).
- TransformedDataset : the materialized augmented dataset returned to the
                       trainer as a Path artifact.

The relationships between them are typed edges:
- ::AppliedBy::     links a dataset to the policy that produced it.
- ::SeededBy::      links a dataset to the seed schedule it used.
- ::Produces::      links a source dataset to a transformed dataset.

A ReproducibilityAuditor walker traverses the lineage and reports each
sample's effective seed plus a digest of the policy+seed triple. Because
the traversal may revisit nodes in a cyclic pipeline graph, the walker
keeps an explicit guard set; reaching a node already in the guard set is
a domain-logic cycle guard, not a bug, and the walker disengages cleanly
when the frontier empties."""

