relationships explicitly:

  * ``ForkSource``   — transcript provenance (fork lineage).
  * ``SpawnedBy``    — runtime ownership / delegation.
  * ``ChannelChild`` — channel/thread containment.

The ``SidebarRenderer`` walker walks the ownership hierarchy. Forks
